    "For women's and men's business, and content not suitable for young people.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "⟦Fór wóméñ's áñd méñ's búsíñéss, áñd çóñtéñt ñót súítáblé fór ýóúñg péóplé.⟧"
