    "An Elder has locked this thread.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "⟦Áñ Éldér hás lóçkéd thís thréád.⟧"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An Elder of %@ will review your request.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "⟦Áñ Éldér óf %@ wíll révíéw ýóúr réqúést.⟧"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An Elder will review it. The author isn't told who reported it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "⟦Áñ Éldér wíll révíéw ít. Thé áúthór ísñ't tóld whó répórtéd ít.⟧"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An Elder will review this comment.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "⟦Áñ Éldér wíll révíéw thís çómméñt.⟧"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An Elder will review your request. You'll see the community here once you're approved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "⟦Áñ Éldér wíll révíéw ýóúr réqúést. Ýóú'll séé thé çómmúñítý héré óñçé ýóú'ré áppróvéd.⟧"
